# Rocky Rebuke: "Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature an opponent controls." The first
# target must be Bot1's own creature and the second an opponent's (the refusals, one per slot). On T5 Bot1's Grizzly Bears (power 2)
# deals 2 to Bot2's Grizzly Bears, which dies; the bite is one-sided, so Bot1's Bears has no damage marked (CR 120.3, 609.7).

